{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "5_01_000_22_5_01_000_22",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:4d20fadd95be17138b40c2d6a981b7f324c5227b5c8846e4a63940e6a4c24a20",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:5_01_000_22_5_01_000_22:5_01_000_22:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:15e4fd1e9366cd6819b30902ea1f4046d1fbb03d95ce904491449d77de8cba2a",
      "text": "传递火热的心意吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_000_22_5_01_000_22:5_01_000_22:cmd-000016:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4f499edebe3878d3acbb94baaf0e9c6da4d71498bf67f98c3ea077685cfb2409",
      "text": "大概是因为到了情人节的时节，在街上闻到巧克力甜香的机会也变多了呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_000_22_5_01_000_22:5_01_000_22:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fd181572f7eb045171726e9014b0bd1e395f8e061fe71e7611f2cc4a621dcd1b",
      "text": "是啊！店里全都换上了情人节的装扮，在工作场合也常听到大家聊起巧克力。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_000_22_5_01_000_22:5_01_000_22:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ac93400784c0e90530e8b9d914b7a46be52324d835dbee2d3b92159cce6bd161",
      "text": "呀，各位！在聊情人节吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_000_22_5_01_000_22:5_01_000_22:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f67e3bd96d6fbc6d4623f995bcc716ac7ddbdfd999f80cd476010f84afe0aca3",
      "text": "社、社长！？您辛苦了……！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_000_22_5_01_000_22:5_01_000_22:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9ab73c10e6530103a58c328dbe34ac0149f0b2c1032eb5001243193429c6e70e",
      "text": "您辛苦了。是的，我正和制作人聊情人节的事。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_000_22_5_01_000_22:5_01_000_22:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:39adc06b3170b5897326ccf4b7c30d8b97cf4d7a3d9610c0b017ae43fac97ada",
      "text": "那正好。关于情人节，我有话要跟你们两位说。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_000_22_5_01_000_22:5_01_000_22:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2083b69207d8d37d36d14d5cf61401ff3cee5e829d4c23d1fa637d32094da94d",
      "text": "我一直希望偶像们能够活力满满地开展活动。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_000_22_5_01_000_22:5_01_000_22:cmd-000051:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:297d0b737f4628ee339b9de45a5b7fe7b98570c9292a15fef76fb6f1938eddf9",
      "text": "是的！我也是！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_000_22_5_01_000_22:5_01_000_22:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:828420f4713fd228ac93839e91573cf455e941903167d24d2ef4f92edbb811c8",
      "text": "嗯，我就知道你会这么回答！那么，我们接着往下说。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_000_22_5_01_000_22:5_01_000_22:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:753242dd6d70113f10e7d38c40effb6bce265499e75f11e66af8f36bfbfa7e05",
      "text": "我发觉了现在的他们所需要的东西。没错，就是巧克力！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_000_22_5_01_000_22:5_01_000_22:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1c304726ed69131d6a7f0db2dbbbe1088db34a85028948eee897f98bea317f0f",
      "text": "当然，普通的巧克力恐怕得不到预期的效果吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_000_22_5_01_000_22:5_01_000_22:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3ae2ad6b2cf003b8918152dd0b516a1eb0c59c42a35626f14c1cb4d18cc2bb0f",
      "text": "但我确信，若是倾注了制作人君的PASSION的巧克力，那就另当别论了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_000_22_5_01_000_22:5_01_000_22:cmd-000062:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:55238d197ddcb08c9cd1ed518361bdfac5d140f440584c5a516ef186cbf766f4",
      "text": "不仅是偶像们，整个315 Production都能因此充满活力吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_000_22_5_01_000_22:5_01_000_22:cmd-000072:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:80e6a0579fa76e8637b2c8119159341818715bfad37747d6ca365f961928bee6",
      "text": "如果由制作人送上巧克力，各位偶像也一定会很开心的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_000_22_5_01_000_22:5_01_000_22:cmd-000074:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2306691e6b00de017493138e770e9422cb6e34303299a6a0e88cc5f29b7e5c81",
      "text": "我明白了！如果我送出巧克力能让各位打起精神来，那就太令人高兴了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_000_22_5_01_000_22:5_01_000_22:cmd-000080:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bb9c264a4c3e31b8433748c34db9c95ed7135391e9409ff7ae7a7dbceb8184f7",
      "text": "情人节期间也请在工作间隙寻找巧克力，送给偶像们吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_000_22_5_01_000_22:5_01_000_22:cmd-000090:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3c027c90282dbd6f06bf66c421b8b59d293948dc4819d8c362b376a365cfb584",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー，挑选巧克力还请加油哦～！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
